kxk|n|A quadruped of the genus Equus (E. asinus), smaller than the horse, and having a peculiarly harsh bray and long ears. The tame or domestic ass is patient, slow, and sure-footed, and has become the type of obstinacy and stupidity. There are several species of wild asses which are swift-footed. ; A dull, heavy, stupid fellow; a dolt.	a:79dx,102,18;4zjw,83,178;5yeq,74,3;ajyc,69,93;2ovl,68,80;v7y,60,4;jk8,59,4;9lmh,58,2;3stf,57,2;3sj3,54,19;55fq,51,51;3zyw,47,1;1xv2,46,22;36hp,46,23;qne,46,293~qne,46,293;wyo,44,226;4zjw,83,178;ajyc,69,93;2ovl,68,80;55fq,51,51;5dsp,10,50;6tfq,7,40;47cb,33,34;1fqp,45,33;6lfq,7,25;36hp,46,23;966d,39,23;1xv2,46,22;3sj3,54,19	v:3zz3,98,14;4zke,91,84;3zyy,90,4;ajgv,89,2;3zyw,82,11;4zkk,80,64;505w,80,9;4zjw,78,128;9lmh,72,5;505p,68,15;8s5n,66,234;16bw,63,3;989v,58,12;8zce,53,3;4zk9,48,5~8s5n,66,234;4zjw,78,128;4zke,91,84;4zkk,80,64;505p,68,15;akyr,41,15;3zz3,98,14;989v,58,12;3zyw,82,11;505w,80,9;36hp,29,7;4zk9,48,5;9lmh,72,5;3zyy,90,4;8zce,53,3	V:a007,153,19;ajgw,133,4;4zk9,89,85;3ycq,71,42;4zke,65,14;505w,64,3;1ga3,61,1;9ma0,39,6;8mdo,34,1;1x42,24,6;1phr,20,14;5vdc,16,10;8y4g,12,1;6otd,10,4;60w,2,3~4zk9,89,85;3ycq,71,42;6kqv,1,21;a007,153,19;4zke,65,14;1phr,20,14;5vdc,16,10;1x42,24,6;9ma0,39,6;6otd,10,4;ajgw,133,4;60w,2,3;505w,64,3;1ga3,61,1;8y4g,12,1	n:ajgv,104,6;8ykz,101,4;68z9,84,16;jo1,81,4;1o5,78,94;9lmh,77,7;ar55,76,4;kxk,75,27;3zyw,67,4;4zjw,64,46;2lel,62,4;8sxj,61,5;3zz3,60,1;7q5l,60,3;53dn,55,6~1o5,78,94;l06,48,80;4zjw,64,46;kxk,75,27;2g6a,19,21;qne,7,20;ajyc,45,18;alxf,2,18;wyo,7,17;68z9,84,16;3xwn,15,15;36hp,40,15;l4x,37,13;8oru,31,11;l9l,18,8	N:a007,142,9;3vpm,96,90;jo1,81,4;kxk,75,27;yci,74,4;2lel,73,9;97xa,73,15;8ajz,68,1;3sqo,59,7;505w,58,2;8ajn,58,6;4zke,55,7;3wbe,43,7;6vq2,40,6;8mdo,34,1~3vpm,96,90;3way,15,42;6kqv,7,33;kxk,75,27;9pht,22,18;97xa,73,15;4ts2,9,14;19jq,29,12;44o6,25,12;2lel,73,9;5j08,9,9;a007,142,9;emd,31,8;9q4q,24,8;3wbe,43,7
